<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-κτάομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.136
				</span></i>
			:—<i>gain, get</i>, or <i>win besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆν ἄλλην π. τῇ ἑωυτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.21
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήσους βασιλέϊ π</span>.
			<i>for</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μακεδόνας πρὸς τοῖσι ὑπάρχουσι
					δούλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἔθνεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.8
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά; χώραν π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.95
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				3.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					12.39
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πρὸς τὴν ἑωυτοῦ μοῖραν</span>
			<i>gain and add</i> to his own portion, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.73
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραχύ τι π. αὐτῇ [τῇ
			ἀρχῇ</span>] <i>make a</i> small <i>addition</i> to it,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.6.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοσούτοις αἰσχροῖς καὶ
				ἐπιορκίαν π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.219
			</span></i>: pf.
			part. in pass. sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ
				προσκεκτημένα</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκ-</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>gain</i> or <i>win over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς π. φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.56
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν Καλλίμαχον</span>
			<i>win over</i> Callimachus <i>to his side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.110
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοὺς Ἀθηναίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.136
				</span></i>
			: c.inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καρίης τὴν πολλὴν π. σφίσι σύμμαχον
					εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.103
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
